1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,200
Most resilience plans can tell you
a backup exists.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:10,000
They cannot tell you whether the critical
workload will actually recover in time.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,800
This is Systemic Resilience Copilot.
Apertus turns a natural-language recovery scenario

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:24,000
into structured evidence. Deterministic rules then identify
the first condition justified by that evidence.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:31,500
In this synthetic case, Northstar Bank
has a sixty-minute recovery tolerance.

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:38,500
The alternate route is independent,
supports the same workload, and has been tested.

7
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:44,000
But observed recovery
takes ninety-five minutes.

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Apertus extracts the stated facts and leaves
what is missing unresolved. The rules receive validated evidence.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Now the decision
is simple and traceable.

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:02,500
Recovery independence passes,
but execution fails.

11
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:08,500
Ninety-five minutes is longer than sixty,
so the workflow stops at S five red, B two.

12
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:12,000
The next action is specific:
repair execution and retest.

13
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Apertus can now challenge and explain
that fixed decision.

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:25,000
It shows why the conclusion follows
and what evidence is still missing.

15
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,000
But it cannot override the rule state.
AI explains. Rules decide.

16
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:36,000
We apply only the justified fix.
Recovery now completes in forty-five minutes.

17
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:42,000
S five passes. But the system
does not declare the bank resilient.

18
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Instead, it reveals the next unresolved question:
simultaneous recovery demand.

19
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Only then do we open
the systemic lens.

20
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Three synthetic institutions may rely
on the same recovery fabric.

21
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Upstream recovery passes, but assured capacity,
priority, and coordination are still unknown.

22
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:13,000
So the correct result is S seven UNKNOWN:
measure capacity and verify entitlements — not invent a shortage.

23
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:18,500
Evidence becomes a decision,
and the decision becomes an action.

24
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:24,000
Missing evidence remains visible.
When the evidence stops, the inference stops.
